=2 Walkthrough
* Go to {z:Rabao} Home Point #2 and speak to {n:Maryoh Comyujah}, who is in (G-7) in front of the windmill.
** Chose the top option 'Sounds fair'. If you spam enter then you won't choose this.
* She will ask you to go to the {z:Quicksand Caves} (again..).
* Head for the secret entrance in {z:Western Altepa Desert} (C/D-11), (Same hidden zone as {M:ZM6: Through the Quicksand Caves|Zilart Mission 6|Through the Quicksand Caves}.)
** This Mission happens in a similar location in the caves, but on the opposite side of the area where you went before. Check the coordinates below to be sure.
** You can use the {p:Proto-Waypoint} in {z:Rabao} at (G-8) to get to Quicksand Caves and enter into the right map (but not the right hole, you still need to go to the other side of the map).
** Alternatively, go to Home Point #1 in Quicksand Caves, and then go east to exit 5 (H-4). Drop down a ledge, and this puts you in a crevasse in Western Altepa Desert (D-10). Take the ramp out of the crevasse, and then proceed south to the secret entrance.
* Inside (On Map 5), go to (K-8) and through the pressure door, this will lead you to Map 6.
** On map 6, head for (G-8) for another pressure door.

!Quicksand Caves-map5.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 5
!Quicksand Caves-map6.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 6
* Enter and fall down the hole. Near where you fall, there is a **???**. Buff up and select "Yes" to dig and spawn a Pot NM {m:Ancient Vessel}. You may need to move very close to the ??? to get it to actually spawn.
** Once you kill the NM, check the **???** again. You will receive the {@k}{k:Scrap of papyrus}.
* Return to {z:Rabao} and speak to {n:Maryoh Comyujah} again. She will give you the {@k}{k:Cerulean crystal}.
* Head back to the Hall of the Gods, touch the Cermet Grate, and watch the cutscene.
* Touch the Grate a second time to pass through.
* Go down the hallway and examine the Shimmering Circle for the last cutscene.

